patch Flattened family=bus
  # The compressor as an effect rather than as glue: so much of it that the
  # loud things and the quiet things arrive at the same size, and the hats end
  # up as prominent as the kick. Unmusical on purpose - one kit in a bank
  # should show what a control does at the end of its travel.
